code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UNI_BOOK_LOW_SerialKiller_DoppelgangerReports_Figaros\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UNI_BOOK_LOW_SerialKiller_DoppelgangerReports_Figaros\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">e16e94f6-be06-4bdf-a7b9-691661b9ef8c</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:e16e94f6-be06-4bdf-a7b9-691661b9ef8c\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:e16e94f6-be06-4bdf-a7b9-691661b9ef8c\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Found on the body of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Soxx\" title=\"Soxx\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Portrait_Soxx.png/25px-Portrait_Soxx.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Portrait_Soxx.png/38px-Portrait_Soxx.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Portrait_Soxx.png/50px-Portrait_Soxx.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Soxx\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Portrait_Soxx.png/25px-Portrait_Soxx.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/02/Portrait_Soxx.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Soxx\" title=\"Soxx\">Soxx</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Facemaker%27s_Boutique\" title=\"Facemaker's Boutique\">Facemaker's Boutique</a>.\n</p>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>Penultimate report - It's an honour and a privilege to watch this Brother in Bhaal in action. The setup for his final, qualifying murder is brilliant and meticulous. After its inevitable culmination, I will be thrilled to join at the <a href=\"/wiki/Murder_Tribunal\" title=\"Murder Tribunal\">Murder Tribunal</a> in acclaiming <a href=\"/wiki/Dolor\" title=\"Dolor\">Dolor</a> as an Unholy Assassin.\n</p><p><br>\n- Shallar Gujj\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202947\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.057 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.062 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2119/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 32060/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 8402/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 933904/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   49.830      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   49.830      1 -total\n 66.28%   33.030      9 Template:Icon_text\n 59.75%   29.771     21 Template:Trim\n 37.40%   18.634      1 Template:PageSeo\n 37.23%   18.553      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 33.54%   16.711      3 Template:CharLink\n 31.35%   15.624      4 Template:Icon_link\n 24.33%   12.125      9 Template:Ifempty\n 19.09%    9.512      2 Template:Uid\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:35190-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714202947 and revision id 365476. Rendering was triggered be